            "notes": "Beast Mode! Yeah! ... no, not yet.\n\nAlways start with [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n\nThe other two items are situational, based on the enemy comp. \n\nIf they are not heavy dive and you can gen more cash:\n- [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318)\n- [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da)\n\nIf they are heavy dive or major burst (Winston, Genji, Phara, Cass, etc.) I usually stack massive HP as early as possible.  Or, simply, if you are still learning and struggling to position consistently:\n- [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e)\n- [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da)\n- [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e) instead to start\n\n[Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) is really good as a 1k item!",
