            "notes": "**Round 2**\n\nSell everything.  Buy [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4).  Start hitting those sleeps on cooldown and setting up plays or simply disabling backline dps or healers.  Don't be afraid to sleep Phara, Junkrat or Juno out of the sky across the map, it's not hard once you get the rhythm!\n\nIdeally, you have enough to also get [Double Dosage](item_80f07e6e-56f9-40a5-9f5e-ba9005998b28).  When you have these two items in round 2, oh man are you going to be hated. \n\nIf there isn't enough cash for [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4), go with a combination of other key items and in round 3, sell evertyhing, get [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4) and [Double Dosage](item_80f07e6e-56f9-40a5-9f5e-ba9005998b28) and continue on. \n\nOther key items:\n- [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46)\n- [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e)\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n- [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da)\n- [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e)\n\nStart spamming them sleeps and win those team fights a man up!  Seek out the backline if you can get clean shots... Repeat, on cooldown!",
