            "notes": "**Round 3**\n\nFill in the final early game key items and if you have the cash buy more goods!  The shop will happily accept your cash and refund you the full amount later!\n\nCritical items for this round as your HP pool should now be significantly higher and you're extremely hard to kill now if you remember to position well.  \n- [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4)\n- [Double Dosage](item_80f07e6e-56f9-40a5-9f5e-ba9005998b28)\n- [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46)\n- [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e)\n\nIf there's no corners to peek I always try to stay LOS behind my tank and keep pumping out those heals.  Keep your tank between you and the enemy tank/dps as much as possible. They are even more of an HP sponge for you - that you pump heals into!\n\nOptional items if your loaded and have cash to spare:\n- [Quick Scope](item_c4ddab86-3ae0-4c5d-92ca-cead87dcec84)\n- [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e)\n- [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a)\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n- [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da)\n- [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e)",
