            "notes": "**Round 4-6**\n\nIn order of priority, these are the remaining items to pickup.  As you get into these later rounds you will soon easily have 500, 600, even 700 HP - you're a beast.  Not only do you have a massive HP pool but you will be feared because of the constant sleeps and you can 1v1 any of the DPS with ease if you can hit your shots; headshot crits hurt like hell!  It takes practice, you have to get good and you'll be an Ana machine.  You need to bring some skill to the table too :).  \n\nAgain, in order of priority:\n- [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124)\n- [Unscoped Resources](item_64c401f6-7508-4fc7-ac3a-93c9f3f57e2b)\n- [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f)\n\nMy final build, typically before a late round 7 game would always be:\n- [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4)\n- [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46)\n- [Double Dosage](item_80f07e6e-56f9-40a5-9f5e-ba9005998b28)\n- [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124)\n- [Unscoped Resources](item_64c401f6-7508-4fc7-ac3a-93c9f3f57e2b)\n- [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f)",
