            "created_at": "2025-09-08T23:24:16.149332+00:00",
            "notes": "**Round 7**\n\nThis is flexible and really depends on your playstyle and what the situation needs to win the round. Typically, I like to go for [Our Turn](item_6e0fdb41-c00f-41d9-8ec2-1246b34a539a) in round 7 and swap out one of the blues for [Eye of Horus](item_169551ce-e4e5-4a14-9ec4-abdc25673939).  This will really turn the tide and let you win team fights with team-wide Nano boosts. Be sure to use it when there are multiple in your vision for optimal potential. If you are REALLY loaded and are comfortable hitting your unscoped shots, you can sell the final blue and take [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) for the final battle.  \n\nIf you're still dying (you really shouldn't be), you can fall back to swapping a blue out for [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) and take [My Turn](item_5cea2ccb-c889-4447-8a84-c704c1da1521) instead.",
